+  *                  31 <= pll_ns <= 500
+  *                  1  <= pll_ms <= 15
+  *
+  *                       pll_rcs_freq
+  *         2mhz <=  ---------------------- <= 16mhz
+  *                          pll_ms
+  *
+  *                       pll_rcs_freq * pll_ns
+  *         500mhz <=  -------------------------------- <= 1200mhz
+  *                               pll_ms
+  * @param  clock_source
+  *         this parameter can be one of the following values:
+  *         - CRM_PLL_SOURCE_HICK
+  *         - CRM_PLL_SOURCE_HEXT
