+/**
+  * @brief  initial xip mode for qspi_x
+  * @param  qspi_x: select the qspi peripheral.
+  *         this parameter can be one of the following values:
+  *         QSPI1,QSPI2.
+  * @param  xip_init_struct: pointer to xip init structure.
+  * @retval none.
